#. えーっと、今日集まったのは…
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So, the people here today..."
msgstr ""

#. 昨日と同じで７人だけか。
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...are the same as yesterday. Just us seven."
msgstr ""

#. 十神と腐川は仕方がないにしても…
msgctxt "0003 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Byakuya and Toko are a lost cause, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 石丸清多夏殿が…来なくなってしまいましたな…
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It looks like Taka's decided to stop coming for good,\n"
"too..."
msgstr ""

#. …相当参ってるみたいだったべ。
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's like he's just...given up."
msgstr ""

#. 根が真面目なだけに、
#. いったん狂いが生じると厄介ですわね。
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"For people wound as tight as he is, when you snap, you\n"
"snap hard."
msgstr ""

#. なんとか立ち直ってくれると…
#. いいんだけどね…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I wish there was some way to make him better..."
msgstr ""

#. それはそうと、霧切さん…
#. 昨日の夜は大丈夫でしたか？
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid ""
"On another topic... Kyoko, did everything go alright\n"
"last night?"
msgstr ""

#. 何も問題なかったわ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Yeah, I didn't have any problems."
msgstr ""

#. さっき確認しに行ったけど、
#. ノートパソコンにも異常はなかった。ただ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I went and checked on the laptop a little while ago,\n"
"and there weren't any problems there, either. But..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで霧切さんは、
#. 周囲を警戒するような声のトーンになり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko seemed to hesitate, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この際だから、ハッキリ言っておくわ。
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's related to this case, so I suppose I should be\n"
"blunt."
msgstr ""

#. 勝手にアルターエゴを使うのは禁止よ。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I have to make a new rule. Using Alter Ego without\n"
"permission is prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. 人が頻繁に脱衣所に出入りしていたら、
#. 黒幕に勘付かれてしまう恐れがあるわ…
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Someone going in and out of the dressing room would\n"
"draw unwanted attention from the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. あら…わかりきった事じゃないですか。
#. どうして、そんな事を？
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I would have thought that would be obvious. Why do we\n"
"need to make a rule about it?"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、どうしてかしらね…？
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's a good question."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、山田君？
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do you have any thoughts on that, Hifumi?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…その通りですな…
#. みなさん…気をつけましょうね…ハハ…
msgctxt "0018 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"N-No... It's just like you said. We all need to\n"
"be...very careful... *Pant pant*"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. いいから、さっさとメシを食わんかーッ！！
#. くっちゃべってる時間はなーいッ！！
msgctxt "0020 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Whatever, let's just hurry up and eat! We don't have\n"
"time to stand around flappin' our lips!"
msgstr ""

#. …鬼軍曹なみの急かし方だべ！
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Jeez! Why're you talkin' like a pissed-off drill\n"
"sergeant all of a sudden!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは慌ただしく朝食を終えると、
#. それぞれの自室へと戻っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We ate breakfast in a rush, then headed back to our\n"
"rooms...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
